# Vercel Speed Insights Installation Report

## Summary
Vercel Speed Insights was **already installed and properly configured** in this project. No code changes were necessary.

## What Was Found

### Package Installation
- `@vercel/speed-insights` package (version 2.0.0) is already listed in `package.json` dependencies
- The package is properly installed via npm

### Configuration
The SpeedInsights component is correctly configured in `frontend/src/main.tsx`:

```typescript
import { SpeedInsights } from "@vercel/speed-insights/react";

createRoot(document.getElementById("root")!).render(
  <>
    <App />
    <Analytics />
    <SpeedInsights />
  </>
);
```

