## Deployment Notes
To see Speed Insights data in your Vercel dashboard:
1. Ensure Speed Insights is enabled in your Vercel project settings
2. Deploy the application to Vercel
3. After deployment, verify the tracking script appears in the page's head tag
4. Performance metrics will populate within a few days after users visit your site

